## Task Completion Definition

A task is complete ONLY when **ALL** conditions are met:

| Condition | How to Verify |
|-----------|---------------|
| Session Start executed | First message contains invar output |
| Intent explicitly stated | "Intent: [what, Core/Shell, edge cases]" |
| Contract before implementation | @pre/@post + doctests appear before code |
| Final invar guard passed | Last message shows `invar guard` success |
| User requirement satisfied | Feature works as requested |

**Missing any condition = Task incomplete. Continue working.**

